        {
          "kind": "dm",
          "title": "DM with Borin",
          "messages": [
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia",
              "text": "Borin. I imagine you've noticed my recent conversations. I want to be straightforward—I'm not plotting anything. I prefer stability to conflict, especially given how things stand between us. But I also won't pretend I don't have concerns about the balance of power. Perhaps we should talk openly about where we go from here."
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Borin",
              "text": "I know you've been talking with others. I want you to know that I have no intention of using my strength against you. Things don't have to change between us just because my position has shifted. I'd rather find a way forward where we both benefit than see anyone form defensive coalitions. What do you need to feel secure?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Borin",
              "text": "Appreciate the directness, Aurelia. I've been paying attention, yes. Stability serves us both better than escalation. I'm open to discussing terms—what did you have in mind?"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "Aurelia",
              "text": "Borin, I appreciate your openness. I need assurances that won't evaporate when convenient. Specifics matter: perhaps formal agreements on resource sharing or clear boundaries we both commit to. What guarantees can you offer that won't leave me dependent on your goodwill alone?"
            }
          ]
        }
